{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1283","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Friends and Gifts"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ friends who want to give gifts for the New Year to each other. Each friend should give "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one gift and receive "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one gift. The friend "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cannot"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" give the gift to himself."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each friend the value $$$f_i$$$ is known: it is either $$$f_i = 0$$$ if the $$$i$$$-th friend doesn't know whom he wants to give the gift to or $$$1 \\le f_i \\le n$$$ if the $$$i$$$-th friend wants to give the gift to the friend $$$f_i$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want to fill in the unknown values ($$$f_i = 0$$$) in such a way that each friend gives "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one gift and receives "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one gift and there is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"no"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" friend who gives the gift to himself. It is guaranteed that the initial information isn't contradictory."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are several answers, you can print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of friends."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$f_1, f_2, \\dots, f_n$$$ ($$$0 \\le f_i \\le n$$$, $$$f_i \\ne i$$$, all $$$f_i \\ne 0$$$ are distinct), where $$$f_i$$$ is the either $$$f_i = 0$$$ if the $$$i$$$-th friend doesn't know whom he wants to give the gift to or $$$1 \\le f_i \\le n$$$ if the $$$i$$$-th friend wants to give the gift to the friend $$$f_i$$$. It is also guaranteed that there is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"at least two"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" values $$$f_i = 0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$n$$$ integers $$$nf_1, nf_2, \\dots, nf_n$$$, where $$$nf_i$$$ should be equal to $$$f_i$$$ if $$$f_i \\ne 0$$$ or the number of friend whom the $$$i$$$-th friend wants to give the gift to. All values $$$nf_i$$$ should be distinct, $$$nf_i$$$ cannot be equal to $$$i$$$. Each friend gives "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one gift and receives "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" one gift and there is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"no"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" friend who gives the gift to himself."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are several answers, you can print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n5 0 0 2 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5 3 1 2 4 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n7 0 0 1 4 0 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 3 2 1 4 5 6 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n7 4 0 3 0 5 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 4 2 3 6 5 1 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n2 1 0 0 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2 1 4 5 3 \n"}],"kind":"s